Description: highly-auditable Python 3 commandlet framework
 Bywaf is a commandlet framework for chaining plugin-driven workflows through
 an auditable event and artifact model. It provides a REPL, runtime entities,
 plugin completion metadata, SQLite-backed event storage, and bundled
 commandlets for discovery, HTTP probing, runtime control, storage, artifacts,
 and local filesystem inspection.
